From c995c2412dd05316ffee94031e356a3e0370cd70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:00:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(worker): preserve steering, heartbeat scope and catalog
 persistence [daveey]

Address PR #3988 independent exact-head review: isolate automatic heartbeat admission failures from operator steering, retain the original delegate-only heartbeat gate including fenced descendant warnings, and resolve/persist the selected model on the prefetch request owner before normal context initialization. Keep all fenced writer and lifecycle paths unchanged.
---
